      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 360,
        "color": 2,
        "content": "## 📁 Where is the code?\n### 👉 [Open CODE_MAP.md](https://github.com/PhamAnhHoangg/IP12-ABB-Data-Automation-project/blob/main/CODE_MAP.md)\nExact **file + line** for every box, also when one job is spread over several files.\n\n**How it stays correct:** each box shows a tag (🏷 `@ip12:yolo`…). Coders put that tag as a comment where the job is done:\n`# @ip12:yolo  run YOLO on the frame`\n\nOn every push to GitHub, the line numbers are recalculated automatically."
      }
    }
